{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GOAL3</strong> is an arcade soccer game where there are no bans and rules! You will have to play fun and unpredictable matches on unique arenas, where nature itself will be the obstacle to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Tournament brings together the best national teams in the world - choose any of the 16 teams and fight for the Champions Cup. Or just play friendly matches - that's fun too! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game features several arenas with unique game mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STADION</strong> - Beware of lightning, it's electrifying and very dangerous!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/GOAL3_Stadium.gif.gif?t=1741150760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WINTER PARK</strong> - The freezing rain will freeze your hottest attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/GOAL3_Park.gif.gif?t=1741150760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BEACH</strong> - Tornadoes are a hoot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/GOAL3_Beach.gif.gif?t=1741150760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BATTLE FIELD</strong> - Geysers are sudden and powerful, just like your attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/GOAL3_Battlefield.gif.gif?t=1741150760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MOON</strong> - You better pass to your teammate, you don't want to get hit by a giant laser, do you?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/GOAL3_Moon.gif.gif?t=1741150760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TRAINING</strong> - Unsure of your skills? Try a workout regimen. I'm sure you'll quickly hone all the skills you need to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/GOAL3_Training.gif.gif?t=1741150760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>COMMANDS:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Argentina</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Brazil</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Cameroon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Croatia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- England</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- France</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Germany</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Holland</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Italy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Japan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Mexico</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Portugal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Russia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Senegal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Spain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Ukraine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Orcs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Elves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Astronauts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Aliens</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/GOAL3_Teams.gif.gif?t=1741150760\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566920?t=1741150760","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/3dcb0a4c9c108003628da2459512ded4d2548981/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741150760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/9ae10b07137444f67d75012642abf2b9c8d2a5f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741150760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/9ae10b07137444f67d75012642abf2b9c8d2a5f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741150760","categories":[{"description